# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MOASYS-Vault — Shows ignore list (template)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Silences warnings you've decided to live with. Copy to
# ignored/<drive>/shows.yaml (e.g. ignored/server/shows.yaml), uncomment what
# you need, and re-run. The real file is gitignored.
#
# Names match exactly at their level, in any category, case-insensitively. An
# entry silences EVERY warning at or below it — scan, validate and Plex. To turn
# off one kind of warning everywhere, use `checks:` in rules/shows.yaml instead.
#
# Full reference: docs/CONFIG.md → "ignored/<drive>/<type>.yaml"
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# A whole category folder
# folders:
#   - Other SD

# One show — e.g. episodes that were never released
# shows:
#   - Firefly (2002)

# One season — must name its show. `Season 2` and `Season 02` are the same.
# seasons:
#   - Band of Brothers (2001)/Specials
#   - Some Show (2020)/Season 2

# One episode — must name its show. The S01E05 code and the full filename
# are interchangeable, and either covers scan and TMDB warnings alike.
# episodes:
#   - Some Show (2020)/S01E05
#   - Some Show (2020)/Some Show (2020) - S01E05 - Title.mp4
